From a22d9430c6fb01b92386685609f14731991aac57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yogesh Sevda <yogesh@example.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 22:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Align bow upgrade with sword/knife: heavy attack on K

Reworks the bow's upgrade to match the pattern already used by sword
and knife, per Ben and Faraj's request to keep upgrade mechanics
consistent across weapons for quality of work.

Light attack (J) now always fires a single arrow; once upgraded it
deals 20% more damage, same as sword and knife (no behaviour change
when not upgraded).

The splitting-arrow effect moves to a new heavy attack on K, only
available once upgraded: three arrows at once (centre + +/-15 degree
spread), each dealing the same damage as an unupgraded shot, with the
shared cooldown doubled afterwards -- mirroring the sword's heavy
attack structure (same pattern, arrow count instead of arc).
---
